# Node.js Services

- Runtime: Node.js 22+, TypeScript, Fastify.
- Package manager: pnpm workspaces.
- Structure: `src/api`, `src/application`, `src/domain`, `src/infrastructure`.
- Use dependency injection; no hardcoded AWS clients in domain/application.
- Vitest for unit/integration tests.
- Export OpenAPI from Fastify or sync with YAML contracts in `contracts/openapi`.
- Local JWT auth first; Cognito adapter behind an interface.
- Decimal-safe money via string/decimal libraries — never floating point for INR/USD jewellery pricing.
- Ports: BFF 3001, admin 5001–5008, Node business services 4001+.
